<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-WINDIES 241 FOR FOUR AT CLOSE V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WINDIES 241 FOR FOUR AT CLOSE V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 241-4 in their second innings, an overall lead of 322, at the close on the fourth day of the first test against India at Sabina Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 427 and 241-4; India 346.</p>
</text>
